Copyright (C) 2026 growdelan
Written with OpenAI Codex assistance.

This project contains a newly written, reduced raster filter. The authors
studied the SpliX implementation to understand QPDL/SPL protocol behavior,
compression packet syntax, and Xerox Phaser 3117 model constants. It is not
a clean-room implementation and does not claim invention of the protocol.

SpliX: Copyright (C) 2006-2008 Aurelien Croc (AP2C) and contributors.
https://github.com/OpenPrinting/splix
macOS reference adaptation: https://github.com/janrueth/splix-2.0.0-macos
The local protocol investigation also used the Rossheper fork of that project.
No third-party driver executables or object files are distributed here.

